Z||000011||fierosound||02-05-2000||05:31 PM||||Shiner...<P>Unfortunately - the people looking when you're cruising and blasting your music through 4 18" subs aren't necessarily "looking 'cause they're impressed" - many may be thinking "what an a$$" etc.  This is something you should also consider.  At an IASCA sponsored sound-off, no problem - that's what everyone is there for.  On the street, you could be asking for trouble.  You've now "advertised" your system, better get an alarm in it!||||reg||10
Z||000012||Shiner||02-05-2000||10:17 PM||||Uh, guys, I hate to break it to you, but I don't have 4 18" subwoofers in my car, nor a "Pimp Daddy and Da Ho's" CD....  I think Monkey understood what my post was about.||||reg||6
